### What pa3ds says in words of its own that only Sun, Moon and the Ultra games have reason to.
### Read before every game's `words.ftl`.

## The Pokédex

# A Pokédex's counts on its first menu, drawn beside a Poké Ball (caught) and a mark (seen) the
# game never names: "Alola Pokédex 3 9" is said "Alola Pokédex, 3 caught, 9 seen".
dex-caught = { $count } caught
dex-seen = { $count } seen

# A Pokémon Center's PC, which the game never names where it stands and opens with no words of its own:
# a thing of the zone's with no script, of kind 8.
kind-PC = PC
